nd_moon_images_without_matching_camera_scene_processing_or output","verify_exact_candidates_run_an_output_normalized_task_matched_trial_and_choose_the_lowest_total_cost_passing_lens_only_if_it_meaningfully_beats_the_kit_otherwise_keep_rent_save_rerun_or_defer"],"constraints":["keep_all_stock_sku_price_rating_review_count_bundle_import_renewed_white_box_bulk_discontinued_warranty_coating_sharpness_stabilization_and_sealing_wording_at_exact_frozen_seller_assertion_scope","bind_every_offer_to_the_exact_lens_or_camera_variant_mount_sensor_format_condition_bundle_and_page_and_do_not_pool_ratings_or_features_across_models","do_not_convert_store_aggregates_prices_l_series_art_or_kit_labels_into_standardized_optical_scores_representative_preferences_or_a_universal_price_quality_curve","treat_the_existing_4000d_and_18_55_iii_as_the_actual_system_baseline_and_do_not_compare_one_lens_price_with_a_whole_bundle_price_as_if_contents_and_condition_were_equal","verify_ef_versus_ef_s_mount_fit_sensor_format_crop_field_of_view_autofocus_aperture_stabilization_filter_hood_and_body_compatibility_for_each_exact_candidate","treat_prime_and_zoom_advantages_as_general_design_tendencies_not_proof_that_one_exact_prime_is_sharper_lighter_or_better_for_every_task","treat_f_number_and_maximum_aperture_as_exposure_depth_of_field_and_test_condition_inputs_not_as_a_guaranteed_sharpness_or_image_quality ranking","use_anti_reflective_coating_only_as_a_reflection_transmission_and_contrast_mechanism_whose_performance_depends_on_wavelength_and_angle_not_as_a_premium_label guarantee","separate_chromatic_aberration_spherical_aberration_vignetting_and_flare_and_measure_each_under_relevant_focus_aperture_frame_position_and_light conditions","treat_otf_or_mtf_as_scale_dependent_contrast_transfer_not_one_context_free_sharpness_number_and_declare_spatial_scale_sensor_processing_display_and_print output","include_diffraction_and_aberration_tradeoffs_across_apertures_and_do_not_assume_stopping_down_always_improves_the_final image","keep_each_community_image_at_its_author_camera_lens_subject_distance_environment_exposure_tracker_stack_calibration_processing_crop_and_output scope","do_not_infer_a_lens_cutoff_from_one_attractive_andromeda_macro_or_moon_image_or_from_missing_camera_and_composite details","verify_current_exact_identity_serial_condition_optics_decentering_focus_aperture_contacts_mount_accessories_warranty_returns_shipping_and_delivered cost","run_a_reversible_same_body_same_operator_task_matched_trial_covering_indoor_family_moving_children_portraits_travel_landscape_backlight_and_the_actual_carry_and_edit workflow","match_field_of_view_perspective_camera_position_framing_focus_target_exposure_and_final_output_size_and_mask_price_and_lens_identity_where practical","track_focus_hit_rate_usable_frame_rate_image_zone_detail_tonal_separation_lateral_color_illumination_falloff_stray_light_subject_separation_stabilization_autofocus_portability_editing_burden_and_finished_output_preference_as_separate_observations","predeclare_minimum_meaningful_improvement_compatibility_condition_workflow_output_and_total_cost_gates_before_unblinding_and_mark_each_pass_fail_or unresolved","choose_only_the_lowest_total_cost_exact_lens_that_passes_every_gate_and_meaningfully_improves_the_declared_outputs_otherwise_keep_the_kit_rent_for_a_special_task_save_for_a_different_need_rerun_or_defer"],"scenario":"A Canon APS-C beginner bought a frozen EOS 4000D small kit with an EF-S 18-55mm f/3.5-5.6 III lens and now hears that lenses matter more than bodies. The intended outputs are ordinary web posts and small prints, and the real tasks are indoor family pictures, moving children, portraits, travel, landscape and backlit scenes. Six frozen seller pages span the 4000D kit at 464.99 dollars, a Canon EF 50mm f/1.8 STM import-model accessory bundle at 158.99 dollars, a Canon EF 40mm f/2.8 STM at 199.99 dollars, a renewed Sigma 35mm f/1.4 Art at 649.99 dollars, a Canon EF 35mm f/1.4L white-box bulk lens at 1098 dollars and a Canon EF 24-70mm f/4L IS zoom at 999 dollars. General sources describe anti-reflective coatings, prime lenses, the Canon EF-S 18-55mm and EF 50mm families, photographic-lens design, chromatic and spherical aberration, vignetting, flare, optical transfer and diffraction. Three community pages are only scoped examples: a detailed tracked and stacked Andromeda workflow, a first macro-lens picture without a controlled comparison and a moon image whose commenters still ask which camera and whether it is a composite. No captured source supplies a same-body, same-scene, output-normalized comparison of the six exact offers, verifies current condition or compatibility, establishes one universal price-to-sharpness cutoff or proves that premium glass, a cheap prime or the kit lens is automatically the right purchase.","target":"Audit what each frozen seller page, lens-family page, optical concept and community image can and cannot establish about upgrading the actual EOS 4000D and EF-S 18-55mm III baseline. Build an exact-offer table that separates price, aggregate, condition, bundle, warranty, mount, sensor-format fit, focal length, aperture, autofocus, stabilization and accessories from unresolved sample quality and current delivery. Explain prime-versus-zoom tradeoffs, coatings, chromatic and spherical aberration, vignetting, flare, scale-dependent OTF or MTF and diffraction without turning any label or price into a universal sharpness ranking. Keep the Andromeda, macro and moon examples tied to their capture, tracker, stack, processing, crop, output and missing metadata. Specify exact identity, compatibility, condition, decentering, focus, aperture, contact, accessory, warranty, return and delivered-cost checks. Design the smallest reversible same-body and same-operator trial for indoor family, moving children, portraits, travel, landscape and backlight, with matched field of view, perspective, framing, focus target, exposure and final web or small-print output. Track usable-frame rate and focus hits; then assess image-zone detail, tonal separation, lateral color, illumination falloff, stray-light behavior, subject separation, IS and AF behavior, portability, editing burden and finished-result preference as distinct observations. Predeclare meaningful-improvement, condition, compatibility, workflow, output and total-cost gates. End with the lowest-total-cost exact passing lens only when it meaningfully improves the declared outputs over the kit, or keep the kit, rent for a special task, save for another need, rerun a corrected comparison or defer."},"graph_motif":"multi_branch_synthesis","graph_node_to_step_id":{"bridge_community_image_workflow_scope":"B1","bridge_lens_value_decision_preparation":"B7","bridge_matched_lens_trial":"B6","bridge_mount_focal_task_scope":"B2","bridge_optical_design_mechanism_scope":"B3","bridge_output_artifact_measurement_scope":"B5","bridge_seller_lens_offer_scope":"B4","decision_evidence_bounded_lens_purchase":"D1","prop_andromeda_workflow_scope":"E1","prop_anti_reflective_coating_scope":"E2","prop_canon_18_55_family_scope":"E3","prop_canon_24_70_l_offer_scope":"E4","prop_canon_35mm_l_offer_scope":"E5","prop_canon_4000d_kit_offer_scope":"E6","prop_canon_40mm_offer_scope":"E7","prop_canon_50mm_aps_c_scope":"E8","prop_canon_50mm_bundle_offer_scope":"E9","prop_chromatic_aberration_scope":"E10","prop_diffraction_limited_scope":"E11","prop_lens_flare_scope":"E12","prop_macro_first_picture_scope":"E13","prop_moon_image_unknowns_scope":"E14","prop_optical_transfer_function_scope":"E15","prop_photographic_lens_design_scope":"E16","prop_prime_lens_scope":"E17","prop_sigma_35mm_renewed_offer_scope":"E18","prop_spherical_aberration_scope":"E19","prop_vignetting_scope":"E20"},"motif_compilation_schema":"graph_motif_compilation_v1","topology_checks":{"has_multiple_independent_branches":true,"has_synthesized_decision":true}},"directly_scorable_gold":false,"discovery_parameters":{"max_expansion_depth":3,"per_stratum":1,"selection_seed":"dra-v3-strata-v1"},"graph_stamp":"evidence-graph-v1:sha256:4a658e8e53fc7ccc18549d860a3b0e263b554ecdd3757ead3d0fc4041fb736dc","schema":"motif_candidate_compilation_bundle_v1"}
